A few rules so everyone can enjoy their shows:

[list]
[*]One thread per episode. Threads are opened automatically after the regular Japanese broadcast.
[*]Keep discussion focused on the episode in the thread title.
[*]No spoilers for future episodes, ever.
[*]Manga / source material talk goes inside [spoiler] tags.
[*]Be respectful. Disagreeing about a show is fine; attacking people is not.
[/list]

Spoiler tags work like this:

[code][spoiler=manga readers only]your text here[/spoiler][/code]

[small]— YAL Staff[/small]', '2012-01-05T03:00:00Z', 'JST', null, null, true, 'reconstructed'),
  ('t-21950', 1, 'FinalBossu', 'av-finalbossu', 'Anime Addict', null, false, 'New year, new thread! Post what you''re currently watching and how it''s going. I''ll start:

