  ('t-21950', 2, 'NekoToast92', 'av-nekotoast', 'Forum Regular', null, false, 'Sinful Apex as well! Monday nights have been sacred since August. Also rewatching some older stuff with my little brother, he''s finally old enough for action shows :3', '2012-01-08T13:02:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'reconstructed'),
  ('t-21950', 3, 'StormWallTheory', 'av-stormwalltheory', 'Senior Member', null, false, 'Sinful Apex and that''s it, I''m a one-show-at-a-time person. I like to sit with things.

I have a THEORY about the last two episodes but I''ll keep it out of here.', '2012-01-09T02:47:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'reconstructed'),
  ('t-21950', 4, 'ShounenLifer_VHS', 'av-vhssamurai', 'Anime Addict', null, false, 'Update: Sinful Apex is DONE. Twenty-four episodes and Miura didn''t waste a single one. Now I need something new for Mondays. Suggestions welcome in the Recs board!', '2012-01-24T10:15:00Z', 'JST', null, null, false, 'reconstructed'),
  ('t-26388', 1, 'NodeCoreOmega', 'av-calsparrow', 'Senior Member', null, false, 'CHAOS Home + Hiroyuki Sawano + 26 episodes. Episode 1 is out, what did everyone think?

